      <text xml:space="preserve">The term '''stopper''' may refer to one of the following

*[[Stopper (knot)|Stopper]], a type of a knot at the end of the rope
*[[Stopper (plug)|Stopper]], a plug or a bung.
*[[Stopper (war)|Stopper]], a term describing an opponent of the [[invasion of Iraq]].
*Stopper, a name sometimes used for a center [[fullback]] in [[soccer]]. 
*The [[Milkor Stopper 37/38 mm riot gun]]. It fires [[teargas]] grenades and [[rubber bullet]]s etc.

