*in the [[United States|United States of America]]
**[[Georgetown, Arkansas]]
**[[Georgetown, California]]
**[[Georgetown, Colorado]]
**[[Georgetown, Connecticut]]
**[[Georgetown, Delaware]]
**in Georgia:
