      <comment>Removed unnecessary uses of the word &quot;Yam&quot;, changed &quot;Yam&quot; to &quot;YAM&quot; when necessary, removed inline Wikilinks per [[MoS:DP]]</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Yam''' may refer to:

*[[Yam (vegetable)]], the common name for members of genus ''Dioscorea''
*[[Yam (route)]], Genghis Khan and the Mongols' supply point system
*A term used to refer to the [[sweet potato]] (''Ipomoea batatas''), especially in the United States
*Another name for [[Yaw (god)|Yaw]], the Levantine god of the untamed sea
*A term used on the streets for ounces of the drug [[cocaine]]

'''YAM''' may also stand for:

*[[YAM (Yet Another Mailer)]], an email client for the Amiga computer
{{disambig}}</text>
    </revision>
